// # oodac package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oodac (layers/L0-core).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oodac.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oodac.oo.
